  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Population Council contribution 2020 - 2022: Investing in Adolescent Girls and Young Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the achievement of the SDG5 with an overall strategic goal of promotion of gender equality through its twofold thematic objective: 
i)	Through evidence based research to get a better understanding on what programmes and polices related to AGYW have the biggest influence on population dynamics and the interface with climate change. 
ii)	And to improve understanding on interface between climate change, AGYW and population dynamics.</narrative>
  </description>
